Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End of the Sea Did you know there's an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.45,0:00:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,awesome treasure hidden\Nat the end of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.71,0:00:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.43,0:00:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.27,0:00:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, have the\Ncourage to sail and believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.85,0:00:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we will see a glimpse of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sun rising on our tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.43,0:00:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started,\Nwe had separate horizons.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.75,0:00:50.92,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord4.6}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.75,0:00:50.92,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(583.02,619.65)}Feeso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.13,0:00:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sailed toward different dreams,\Nthings have changed now.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.30,0:00:56.22,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord4.6}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.30,0:00:56.22,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:01:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For together we found, we looked\Nthrough the spyglass and see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.31,0:01:01.56,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord4.6}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.31,0:01:01.56,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(583.02,619.65)}Galaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NPhosCity\NScolines\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.51,0:01:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.56,0:01:08.32,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord4.6}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.56,0:01:08.32,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.05,0:01:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the conscious points our destiny.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.32,0:01:12.32,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord4.6}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.32,0:01:12.32,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.75,0:01:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no looking back,\Ntake the hell with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, we can't stop all\Nour troubles, forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the future's\Nunclear, we still can smile.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.33,0:01:27.96,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord4.6}Timing/Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.33,0:01:27.96,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(129.69,159.65)}Gab
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No regrets.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.96,0:01:32.01,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord4.6\pos(24,113)}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.96,0:01:32.01,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(67.02,153.65)}AphantasticRabbit\NGab\NLorphex\Npanda >\NWestfal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.73,0:01:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every tear that we've cried only helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.93,0:01:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our dreams come true.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.09,0:01:37.55,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord4.6\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.09,0:01:37.55,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\pos(1007.02,152.05)}arch1t3cht\NChloelyy\NFunimation\NPamkinPenguin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.73,0:01:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.73,0:01:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.32,0:01:57.12,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(352,0)\bord2\c&HF9F9F9&\1a&HFF&\t(311,352,\1a&H00&)}Dial Battle
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.32,0:01:57.12,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(352,0)\c&HF9F9F9&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Dial Battle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.13,0:01:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.04,0:01:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the wrong way, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.97,0:02:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be going west!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.09,0:02:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, west, this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.91,0:02:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, I can't believe\Nyour sense of direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.39,0:02:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's going east.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.31,0:02:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.51,0:02:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your head for something\Nbesides a hat rack for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.33,0:02:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to go to\Nthe skull's right eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.37,0:02:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we gotta go right, you rubber brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go tell\Nthose two heroes that we're
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.49,0:02:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,supposed to be heading south\Nbefore they end up lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.09,0:02:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.41,0:02:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro! Wait up, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.81,0:02:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,South, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have said so sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.41,0:02:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, that's a pretty\Nneat stick you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.01,0:02:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's mine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.84,0:02:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta get your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.75,0:02:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.66,0:02:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's mine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta get your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.49,0:02:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aww, I want one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.65,0:03:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stick! Stick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.11,0:03:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with sticks?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.53,0:03:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought this course would be scarier,\Nbut so far, it's been nice and peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.03,0:03:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, you're in\Na pretty good mood today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.13,0:03:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You feeling courageous for a change?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yup, you betcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so safe with these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.75,0:03:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The forest really has\Nbeen a big disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.27,0:03:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to admit birds and trees for two whole
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,days makes me want to scream I'm so bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.09,0:03:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't even seen\None of Eneru's priests,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.43,0:03:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I know exactly how you\Nfeel, Chopper. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just listen to the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you that eager for\Nsomething dangerous to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.53,0:04:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.85,0:04:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wind, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Helm, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.81,0:04:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.23,0:04:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like a pleasure cruise,\Nbut we're making bad time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.07,0:04:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Navigator, pick up the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.67,0:04:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we can't, Captain Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.49,0:04:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Milky Road gets\Npretty steep in places,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we have to rely on\Ndial power to get by.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.19,0:04:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pour it on, little crow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, you are my official bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.45,0:04:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain is afraid\Nof this creepy forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, for crying out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only person I'm planning on\Nprotecting is my little Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's about time for that\Nweird knight's medicine, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.93,0:04:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember where Chopper\Nsaid he was gonna put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.49,0:04:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Gan Fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.93,0:05:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Conney.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.39,0:05:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he left it sitting on\Na barrel down in the galley.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.27,0:05:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you grab it, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.93,0:05:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I tell you a little\Nof this land's history?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.65,0:05:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You back again, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.39,0:05:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.11,0:05:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough, Wiper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gonefall is here to negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.17,0:05:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Negotiate what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Chief. We're through.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not going to stand\Nby while two old men
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,negotiate away everything we\Nfought for our whole lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can forget about any kind of treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want compromise so\Nbadly, then give it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.53,0:05:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For generations we've watched you sky\Npeople slaughter us like little pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.75,0:05:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now you're saying that\Nyou want to make peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot give it all back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of the Upper\NYard's birth is of the utmost
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,importance to every man and\Nwoman now living in Scypia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All are grateful for its many blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.27,0:06:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no right to take that away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.11,0:06:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These people are, after all, innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.59,0:06:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so the Scypia people\Nare innocent, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.65,0:06:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you can call them\Nthat since they let you do
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their fighting for them and\Nnever bloody their own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's time we involved\Na few innocent people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.79,0:06:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.79,0:06:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want peace so badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.49,0:06:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Execute a hundred of\Nyour own innocent people
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.15,0:06:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the ancient altar and\Nbring us their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.57,0:06:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.61,0:06:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we're done talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.47,0:06:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get lost, or I'll take your\Nhead as a down payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.77,0:06:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, wiper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.97,0:06:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful when you use my name, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.59,0:07:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am quite fond of the juice\Nmade from your pumpkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.01,0:07:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.63,0:07:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warriors, restrain him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.85,0:07:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this? Kamakiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.07,0:07:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Braum, not you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.45,0:07:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aisa cries a lot, doesn't she, Nurse?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.21,0:07:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, she always cries when there's\Na disturbance in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.23,0:07:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Wiper, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.45,0:07:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't know, but\Nyou have to admit when
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are problems in\Nthe village he's right
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.17,0:07:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the middle of them\Nwhy what do you think of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:08:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him Lock I think that\Nhe frightens me as well
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.77,0:08:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's like a demon
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.06,0:08:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Fourth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.43,0:08:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you before!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.01,0:08:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Isha's treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.11,0:08:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no right to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.79,0:08:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Braham...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.95,0:08:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't assume we'll get\Nanother chance like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.27,0:08:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let this opportunity pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.11,0:08:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't think you're\Nup to it, stay behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't hold it against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.61,0:08:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know we're up to it. Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.81,0:08:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you up to abandoning anyone\Nwho falls during the battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:09:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can step over the bodies of\Nyour dying comrades and keep fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I swear, Enoru's head is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.17,0:09:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until six years ago, I was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.17,0:09:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, did you hit your head, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.85,0:09:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you have no doubt learned,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.97,0:09:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it is believed that the Upper Yard first
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,appeared in Skypiea abruptly\Na good 400 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.85,0:09:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then, Skypiea had always\Nbeen a peaceful Sky Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Items from the Blue Sea that were\Noccasionally brought here by the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knock-up stream were rare and\Nvaluable treasures to the Sky people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.05,0:09:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Likewise,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of the Fourth on the Sky Islands\Nwas brought here by the knock-up stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.75,0:10:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a quantity of Fourth\Nas vast as the upper yard
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.15,0:10:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,appearing in the sky seemed\Nlike an unimaginable miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.19,0:10:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sky People were understandably\Noverjoyed and worshipped it as holy ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.85,0:10:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a gift from heaven itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.47,0:10:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the original inhabitants\Nwere still on that birth,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.21,0:10:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a war erupted over its possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.93,0:10:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those inhabitants were the Shandians.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.61,0:10:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they're the gorillas?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.91,0:10:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.82,0:10:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're saying the Shandians used to live
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.51,0:10:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on Jaya when it was still in the Blue Sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The current blasted them into\Nthe sky against their will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.59,0:10:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, does that mean that you just\Nstole the land that was rightfully theirs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.31,0:10:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.22,0:10:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sky People's greed drove them\Nto steal the Shandorians' homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.03,0:10:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for the last 400 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.99,0:10:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the war between the Shandians and the\NSky People has gone on without a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.43,0:11:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Shandians are simply trying\Nto regain their lost home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.91,0:11:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All those lives lost. Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.67,0:11:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that make you the bad guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.63,0:11:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.29,0:11:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid that's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.35,0:11:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I almost forgot to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.27,0:11:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Enel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.23,0:11:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.25,0:11:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's his story?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I was still gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.89,0:11:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he appeared from another Sky\NIsland, leading a group of warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.75,0:11:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They dealt a heavy blow to my\NDivine Squad and to the Shandians.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.87,0:11:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they seized control\Nof the Upper Yarn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.77,0:11:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.87,0:11:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since then nearly all the\NDivine Squad have been
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enslaved and forced to\Nperform some mysterious labor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.07,0:11:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.57,0:11:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the Shandians don't care who God is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.71,0:12:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They want what they've always\Nwanted, the return of their homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.85,0:12:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.01,0:12:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If all these Shandians are interested\Nin is getting their homeland back,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then why did they attack\Nus the minute we showed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The members of the Divine\NSquad sometimes steal a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.15,0:12:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ship in hopes that they might\Nescape from Enderu. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.95,0:12:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Shandians still consider\Nthe Divine Squad enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they will eliminate them on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.11,0:12:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have mistaken you for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.79,0:12:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes it all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.33,0:12:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One reason I became the Sky\NKnight was to help these
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.45,0:12:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,escapees make it safely\Naway to other Sky Islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no place on\Nthe Upper Yard that such
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.01,0:12:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,outlaws would be able\Nto avoid Eneru's eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.65,0:12:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To hear the way you tell it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.99,0:12:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This Enel guy sounds like he\Nmust be the devil himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.03,0:12:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all we know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.94,0:12:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's out there right now listening to\Nevery word we're saying and taking notes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.81,0:12:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,notes, notes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:12:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.09,0:13:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't tell me you've\Nsuddenly become a convert.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.69,0:13:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you heard what the\Nold man said. Scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.79,0:13:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The devil himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.33,0:13:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but he comes very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.43,0:13:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enel has decreed that all outsiders\Nlike yourselves are criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.97,0:13:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.89,0:13:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he has made the inhabitants of Skypiea\Nresponsible for leading them to judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.05,0:13:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This gives rise to the\Nislander's sense of guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.47,0:13:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the people believe they\Nare committing a criminal act,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.19,0:13:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they become overwhelmed by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.39,0:13:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It weakens their will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.61,0:13:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eneru knows this and exploits it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has created a flock of\Nhelpless lambs to rule over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.73,0:13:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lives of the people\Nare like playthings to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The devil indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.71,0:13:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we landed on Angel Beach we thought\Nwe'd found something like a paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.99,0:13:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy were we wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.01,0:14:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all the places that\Nancient city of gold
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.51,0:14:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could have ended up being\Nthis is just our luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.81,0:14:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.72,0:14:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right. This city\Nyou sure were excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about it but please tell\Nme something what is gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.01,0:14:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.55,0:14:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a giant snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.27,0:14:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.53,0:14:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's another\Nresult of the environment here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.79,0:14:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Catfish Face, it's\Ntime for you to get belayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the hell can something\Nso big move so freaking fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.41,0:15:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, change of plan. We're running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.51,0:15:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let that venom\Ntouch you! It's death!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.97,0:15:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.88,0:15:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Snake! Over here! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.61,0:15:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.03,0:15:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your dinner's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.69,0:15:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.83,0:15:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.57,0:15:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He goes here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.57,0:15:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha! Nice try!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.59,0:15:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was awesome, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.65,0:16:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally managed to make my\Nway around the back of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.25,0:16:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.77,0:16:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way, whispers! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.07,0:16:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.98,0:16:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'm on the right path,\Nbut when are you missing from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.41,0:16:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I pay for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.07,0:16:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm lost, guys! Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.59,0:16:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.85,0:16:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I turn my back for one second\Nand they go and get lost on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.53,0:16:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.45,0:16:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They know how to take care of themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.31,0:17:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I got most of the\Nmap memorized anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I go to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.73,0:17:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did everybody go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.55,0:17:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they get lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.75,0:17:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.19,0:17:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up with them\Nlater at the ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.29,0:17:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin said we had to go south, and it\Nalways gets warmer when you go south?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I go this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.81,0:17:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we first met, I acted as a\Nsoldier for hire to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.73,0:17:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you blue sea\Ndwellers are unfamiliar
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.47,0:17:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the ways of sky warfare,\Nsky warfare? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.31,0:17:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now observe with someone explained\Nto me why we're doing this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.01,0:17:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all will be clear now strike that\Nshell with all of your might!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.23,0:17:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young man take it easy Sanji\Nif you put a hole in my deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll put enough holes in you\Nto make a Swiss cheese jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.75,0:17:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hit it with all the strength you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.83,0:17:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Respect for other people's property\Nwhen you're a guest old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:17:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's your show, old-timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.19,0:17:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.69,0:18:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have to wind up into it like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.99,0:18:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.90,0:18:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was just sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.41,0:18:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I said take it easy, but you\Ndidn't have to be that pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.03,0:18:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't even put a ding in the barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.40,0:18:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave that swing everything I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I was really trying\Nto put a hole in the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.07,0:18:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.19,0:18:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds crazy, but it's like this shell\Nabsorbed all the force of the impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.02,0:18:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you'd be so good as\Nto turn the shell's holes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,towards the barrel and lightly\Npress the tip on the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're familiar with the\Noperation of dial power, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.09,0:19:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That my friends is an\Nimpact dial. It absorbs any
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.59,0:19:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,impact it receives and\Nthen releases the energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it's pressed it is\Nfrequently affixed to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.39,0:19:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the palm of the hand with\Na glove or a bandage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.07,0:19:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A direct hit from one\Nof these has more than
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.33,0:19:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough power to kill an\Naverage person easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.45,0:19:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know. Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.41,0:19:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what that butterball\Npriest was using.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.25,0:19:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I warned you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.91,0:19:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.91,0:19:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you warn us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.09,0:19:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That scared the hell out of me, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.57,0:19:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have heard that in ancient\Ntimes on other Sky Islands,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.97,0:19:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there existed dials even\Nmore powerful than this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.71,0:19:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The so-called Reject Dial was said\Nto be capable of magnifying the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,energy it stored and released ten\Ntimes the power of a mere impact dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.75,0:19:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that incredible power\Nwas a double-edged sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for it threatened the life of the\Nattacker as well as his opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.45,0:20:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a result, it was very rarely used.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These little shells are that dangerous\Nthey're worse than any weapon I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.21,0:20:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah I thought Dials were supposed\Nto be common everyday objects so they
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.13,0:20:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are but it seems that man has a talent\Nfor Finding deadly uses for beneficial
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.03,0:20:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,discoveries no matter how mundane\Nthey may seem to be it all Depends
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.19,0:20:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,upon the user dials are very useful
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.55,0:20:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when applied in battle their Powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.49,0:20:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,destruction can be awesome for\Nexample the heat dial used for cooking
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.23,0:20:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can be placed inside a lance and used\Nto generate thermal energy creating
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.93,0:20:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Deadly weapon known as the heat\Njavelin or the flame dial which stores
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.17,0:21:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fire can be placed in the mouth of a\Nbird, creating a creature that seems
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.83,0:21:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to breathe fire yeah Chopper mentioned\Nsomething like that and that's sky
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.63,0:21:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,warfare it is blue sea dwellers who\Nknow Nothing of dials have no way of
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.57,0:21:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seeing through these tricks the same\Nholds true for our many Types of
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.43,0:21:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,artificial clouds the priests have\Nforged these into forms they can control
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.81,0:21:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't understand them, you'll\Nbe helpless against them. Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.27,0:21:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then is there any truth to that Mantra\Nthing that tubby was talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.95,0:21:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that let him predict our moves yes\Nmantra unfortunately I'm afraid that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.95,0:21:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i myself am unable to use it so it's\Nrather difficult for me to explain
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.63,0:21:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mantra is described as an ability\Nto hear the ideas that as long
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.43,0:21:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a person lives, his or her\Nbody emits its own voice. A voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.15,0:21:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yes by listening to the voice\Nyou're supposed to be able to know
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.53,0:22:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your opponent's next move with\Npractice and training you can hear
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.81,0:22:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these voices over a very Large\Narea the priests can hear over all
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.89,0:22:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the upper yard enaru's powers\Nextend across this Entire land
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.51,0:22:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the exact nature of those powers\Nremains a mystery but because of
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.19,0:22:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them the people People of this land\Ncan never know a moment's ease.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:22.67,0:22:28.60,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(558,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp0\fscx90\fscy90\c&HFFFFFF&\blur0.8\an5\pos(726,740)}God's Shrine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.67,0:22:28.60,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(558,0)\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord2.5\fsp0\fscx90\fscy90\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(517,558,\1a&H00&)\blur0.8\an5\pos(726,740)}God's Shrine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.77,0:22:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they've made\Nit down yet. Yes, Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.49,0:22:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are lying in wait as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.83,0:22:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The three priests have\Nplaced their ordeals,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.71,0:22:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Commander Yama has taken\Nfifty divine warriors with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.97,0:22:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Lord, it looks as though\Nthis is becoming an Alto war.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.33,0:22:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really necessary\Nto go to such extremes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Shandians and a few blue sea\Ndwellers hardly seem worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.23,0:22:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.57,0:22:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more players there\Nare, the more fun the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.53,0:23:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, my hairy friend, underestimate\Nthe power of sky warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.97,0:23:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky warfare, my lord? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.35,0:23:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.99,0:23:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heal that for me, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.69,0:23:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.71,0:23:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the fifty divine warriors at our\Ndisposal, plus our three surly priests.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.91,0:23:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Including me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.03,0:23:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fifty-four.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.61,0:23:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are twenty Shandians\Nheading toward the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.51,0:23:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the four blue sea-dwellers in the forest,\Nand the four escaping down the Milky Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.09,0:23:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, that's only three.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.25,0:23:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old man can't fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.09,0:23:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Altogether, that makes eighty-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.15,0:23:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This battle will determine\Nwho will be left standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.93,0:23:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we guess how many will\Nremain after three hours' time?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.05,0:23:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon, Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.19,0:23:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wish us to make a game out of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.65,0:23:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, why don't you lighten up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.63,0:23:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, take a guess. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.51,0:23:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you talking to me, my Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.75,0:23:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.66,0:23:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.33,0:23:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a humble servant girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.09,0:24:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.15,0:24:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.41,0:24:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.43,0:24:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.37,0:24:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any guess at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.67,0:24:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.58,0:24:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.50,0:24:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.41,0:24:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.39,0:24:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, um, the three priests are all very\Nstrong, of course, and those divine...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.71,0:24:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,warriors are all extremely powerful\Nas well i doubt many of them will
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.59,0:24:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be defeated but the enemy has shown\Ntheir power rivals the priests so
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.25,0:24:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in three hours time i think 30 will\Nfall leaving let's see 81 minus 30?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.93,0:24:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leaving 51 alive, how's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.13,0:24:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,51, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.04,0:24:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's your best guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.51,0:24:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're being just a little\Noptimistic, or are you just squeamish?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.27,0:24:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're underestimating\Nthe results of this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.99,0:24:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, then what do you think,\Nmy lord, if I may ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.59,0:24:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's obvious if only\Nyou'd give it a little thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.03,0:25:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In three hours, of the 81 fighters now on\Nthis island, all that will be left are...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.93,0:25:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.03,0:25:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.91,0:25:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.93,0:25:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.49,0:25:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I stop moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.49,0:25:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greetings, my Shandora friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.81,0:25:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're looking well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.01,0:25:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you could come to my party.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.25,0:25:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.71,0:25:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your enthusiasm,\Nbut honestly, I know my own name.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.65,0:25:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I've got some very bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.93,0:26:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There have been a few changes made\Nhere on Upper Yard since last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.27,0:26:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't move, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.27,0:26:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.53,0:26:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You only have a 3 % chance of surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.31,0:26:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Ordeal of String.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.07,0:26:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not the Ordeal of String!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.17,0:26:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have warned you, but then I\Nthought, why ruin the surprise for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.17,0:26:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's string clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.59,0:26:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.63,0:26:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.31,0:26:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's spread throughout my area too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.79,0:26:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thin to be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.05,0:26:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But so tough that even the\Nstrongest man can't break free.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.75,0:26:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once entangled.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.35,0:26:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mighty string clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.27,0:27:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fools have been\Nwrapping yourselves up in
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.85,0:27:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it from the moment you\Nset foot in this forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.43,0:27:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.01,0:27:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your bodies are covered in string.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.95,0:27:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've all become my puppets.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.95,0:27:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mere playthings at my disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.77,0:27:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.91,0:27:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you except for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.95,0:27:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fly, Vice!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.35,0:27:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WIPER!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.59,0:27:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't beat me in the air, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.83,0:27:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.13,0:27:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a heat javelin!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.79,0:27:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you throw away\Nyour shield and weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.71,0:27:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.51,0:27:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you wouldn't dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.71,0:27:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.79,0:27:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If all you want's a shoulder, it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.21,0:28:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An impact dial?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.07,0:28:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that can't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.41,0:28:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.67,0:28:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten times that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.03,0:28:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reject dial!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.63,0:28:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the upper yard survival game has
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.27,0:28:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its first casualty now only 80 remain so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.27,0:28:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first battle has\Nended in a stunning upset!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.27,0:28:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.31,0:28:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.09,0:29:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like you, Shit underestimated\Nthe power of sky warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.13,0:29:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.67,0:29:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But surely this is a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.39,0:29:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No priest has been defeated in six years,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.79,0:29:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now suddenly two have fallen\Nin as many days. Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.83,0:29:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they were defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.29,0:29:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.39,0:29:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they lacked divine protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.63,0:29:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.09,0:29:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're up against 20 Xandorians\Nand seven blue sea-dwellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.97,0:29:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They pose no threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.43,0:29:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need to trouble\Nthe priests with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.07,0:29:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy them without mercy. Go.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:39.11,0:29:42.66,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&HF6F4F7&\blur1.3\an5\pos(720,590)}50 Warrior Monks\NSkypiea
Dialogue: 1,0:29:39.11,0:29:42.66,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord4.5\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&HE6E4E6&\1a&HFF&\blur1.3\an5\pos(720,590)\3c&H212125&}50 Warrior Monks\NSkypiea
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.87,0:29:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can step over the bodies of\Nyour dying comrades and keep fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.71,0:29:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.63,0:29:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I swear, Inneru's head will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.01,0:30:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we kill Inneru,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.77,0:30:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there will be no need for you to sneak\Naround obsessing over a single bag of Fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.37,0:30:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A single bag of Fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.53,0:30:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper, what were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.47,0:30:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just try using that reject dial again!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.03,0:30:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll blow your body to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.71,0:30:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my body, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.53,0:30:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I warned you—we'd have to take\Nrisks if we wanted victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.83,0:30:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never beat them if we\Naren't willing to make sacrifices!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.99,0:30:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.90,0:30:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,understand
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.89,0:31:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.51,0:31:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you all standing\Naround for? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.45,0:31:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of enemy\Nterritory, so let's split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.45,0:31:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are still two priests\Nout there left to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.89,0:31:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like they've changed\Nthe location of their ordeals.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.29,0:31:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't have everyone getting\Ncaught in the same ordeal again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.85,0:31:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to be smarter than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.21,0:31:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.77,0:31:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh. Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.73,0:31:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.47,0:31:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't forget to pray for our safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.13,0:31:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.27,0:31:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.71,0:31:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll meet at God's Shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.35,0:31:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.59,0:32:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.55,0:32:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,House?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.61,0:32:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A divine soldier? Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.61,0:32:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By order of Almighty Enel,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.73,0:32:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've been commanded to purge his enemies\Nfrom the width and breadth of Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.81,0:32:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are Lord Eneru's Elite.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.43,0:32:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no place for you to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.69,0:32:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We possess the power of the Axe,\Nwhich is not found in Skypiea.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.91,0:32:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.53,0:32:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your efforts are futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.45,0:32:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your shot's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.53,0:32:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Axe Dial!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.15,0:32:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your shield won't help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.19,0:32:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the islands in the south are warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.83,0:33:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And their heads get really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.67,0:33:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They grow up pineapples,\Nthey grow up coconuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.99,0:33:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're morons?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.69,0:33:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A goat?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.47,0:33:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that a goat?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.89,0:33:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.27,0:33:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.81,0:33:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's this jerk?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.37,0:33:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, he got me all excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.23,0:33:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna get to see a goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.53,0:33:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next verse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.83,0:33:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Islands in the north are snowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.19,0:33:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And their heads get really cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.97,0:33:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're very chilly-chilly, they're\Nvery willy-nilly, and they're idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.11,0:33:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.77,0:33:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.09,0:34:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.73,0:34:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I warned you to leave\Nthis island. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.47,0:34:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do whatever I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.35,0:34:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.67,0:34:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This island belongs to us\NShandians. Huh? Really? It does?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.09,0:34:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was God's.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.21,0:34:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.09,0:34:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next verse!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.47,0:34:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Islands in the east of\N- Hold it! Oh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.07,0:34:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.13,0:34:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm through wasting words on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.41,0:34:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm sick and tired of\Nlistening to your idiotic babbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.85,0:34:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.41,0:34:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.45,0:34:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to fight,\Nyou just have to say so.

